[00:07.520]Let's make this fleeting moment last forever
{"让这转瞬即逝的瞬间成为永恒"}
[00:10.190]
[00:12.910]So, tell me what you're waiting for?
{"所以，你还在等待什么？"}
[00:14.190]
[00:15.020]I'm gonna keep it frozen here forever,
{"我要将此刻永远冰封珍藏"}
[00:17.600]
[00:20.660]There's no regretting anymore.
{"再也不会有遗憾"}
[00:21.520]
[00:22.510]It's worth the wait, even so far away.
{"纵使相隔万里也值得等待"}
[00:24.660]
[00:26.310]I'm making the night mine until the day I die
{"我将独占这夜色直至生命尽头"}
[00:28.890]
[00:30.080]No lights to brake when you're hanging by fate
{"当命运悬于一线时无需刹车灯"}
[00:32.540]
[00:33.790]You know what it feels like when you're dancing blind
{"你懂蒙眼起舞时的那种感觉"}
[00:36.040]
[00:37.600]All alone, just the beat inside my soul
{"独自一人，只有节拍在灵魂深处跳动"}
[00:39.820]
[00:41.320]Take me home, where my dreams are made of gold
{"带我回家，那里有黄金铸就的梦想"}
[00:43.980]
[00:45.080]In the zone where the beat is un-controlled.
{"在这律动失控的领域里"}
[00:47.320]
[00:48.830]I know what it feels like
{"我明白那种感觉"}
[00:50.000]
[00:50.640]Come on make me feel alive
{"来吧让我重获新生"}
[00:52.090]
[00:52.560]Feel Alive~
{"感受活着"}
[00:56.580]
[00:57.340]
[01:55.320]Meet me under shining lights,
{"在璀璨灯光下与我相会"}
[01:57.030]
[01:58.560]I've been waiting right here all my life
{"我此生都在此处等候"}
[02:00.840]
[02:02.790]Feelings you can't deny that you're living, open up your eyes
{"你无法否认活着的悸动，睁开双眼吧"}
[02:05.980]
[02:10.100]And I just wanna sink into your crazy laughter
{"我只想沉溺于你疯狂的笑声中"}
[02:12.510]
[02:13.980]Come on make me feel until the pain don't matter
{"来吧让我感受直到疼痛不再重要"}
[02:16.320]
[02:17.820]Every second here makes my heart beat faster
{"此处的每一秒都让心跳加速"}
[02:20.540]
[02:21.560]Finally think I found what I'm chasing after.
{"终于明白自己追寻的是什么"}
[02:23.800]
[02:25.300]All alone, just the beat inside my soul
{"独自一人，只有节拍在灵魂深处跳动"}
[02:27.970]
